{"id":1020201,"chapter_id":1020201,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"新人：\n\n  听说你一直在收集有关狂厄、死役和内海的情报。相信你已经发现了，真相与你的过去有关。\n\n  最近你的情报工作好像陷入了瓶颈。这很正常，有些事情你现在还接触不到。给一个小小的提示吧：去问问你新收容的禁闭者。\n\n  诺克斯，最接近内海真相的人。\n\n  祝你好运，新人。","style":10,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201001,"trial_step":1,"drawing":1020201},{"step":2,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"终点离你还很遥远……你也需要拯救吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201003,"trial_step":3,"drawing":1020201},{"step":3,"content":"拯救？没有人需要你拯救。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201004,"trial_step":4,"drawing":1020201},{"step":4,"content":"你刚刚进入审查室、坐到诺克斯对面，她便问出了一个有些奇怪的问题。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201005,"trial_step":5,"drawing":1020201},{"step":5,"content":"这是审查，禁闭者诺克斯。我提问，你回答，这是你的义务。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201006,"trial_step":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":6,"content":"诺克斯没有回应。对此你早有预料。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201007,"trial_step":7,"drawing":1020201},{"step":7,"content":"以你过去的经验来看，与这种意识支离破碎、难以交流，又拥有极强力量和攻击性的禁闭者打交道，这次审查必然困难重重。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201008,"trial_step":8,"drawing":1020201},{"step":8,"content":"但这不是退缩的借口。你将桌上的档案摊开——这是本次审查的最佳切入口。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201009,"trial_step":9,"drawing":1020201},{"step":9,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":10,"course":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":10,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":10,"course":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":11,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":10,"course":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":12,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":10,"course":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":13,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":10,"course":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":14,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":10,"course":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":15,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":10,"course":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":16,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":10,"course":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":17,"content":"诺克斯对你的举动毫无反应，甚至没有看桌上的资料一眼。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1020201},{"step":18,"content":"你知道“禁闭者死神”吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1020201},{"step":19,"content":"诺克斯的泛白的瞳孔依旧无光。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1020201},{"step":20,"content":"“内海幽灵”、“夜魇”、“祸巫”……总该有一个你听说过的吧？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1020201},{"step":21,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1020201},{"step":22,"content":"这些都市传说，或者说恐怖故事形象已经流行了近三十年。你真的一无所知？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1020201},{"step":23,"content":"你的受害者死前也该说些什么吧？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1020201},{"step":24,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"……你想听？","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1020201},{"step":25,"content":"我需要知道。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1020201},{"step":26,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1020201},{"step":27,"content":"灰黑色雾气自诺克斯体内涌出，审查室内凭空涌出无数声嘶力竭的呼号。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1020201},{"step":28,"speaker":"？？？","content":"别过来。","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1020201},{"step":29,"speaker":"？？？","content":"不要杀我。","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1020201},{"step":30,"speaker":"？？？","content":"杀了她！","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1020201},{"step":31,"speaker":"？？？","content":"杀了我……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1020201},{"step":32,"content":"几秒后，耳边的哭嚎消退，背后的冷汗濡湿了你的衬衫。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1020201},{"step":33,"content":"不仅仅忌惮着诺克斯诡异的能力，你的不安更多来自那些呼号中无法忽视的恐惧和绝望。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1020201},{"step":34,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1020201},{"step":35,"content":"我可以理解为，你在承认自己就是“禁闭者死神”？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1020201},{"step":36,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"我从来没有这样称呼过自己，不过……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1020201},{"step":37,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"……我喜欢这个名字。","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1020201},{"step":38,"content":"诺克斯没有否认“禁闭者死神”的身份。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1020201},{"step":39,"options":["进一步质问"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201033,"trial_step":33,"course":3,"drawing":1020201,"choices":[{"text":"进一步质问","goto":34}]},{"step":40,"content":"自入夜84年起，当局一共收到过639起“死神”目击报告。其中511起未有伤害记录，27起已结案。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1020201},{"step":41,"content":"还有101起至今未能寻找到凶手。这些悬案……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1020201},{"step":42,"content":"都是你做的吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1020201},{"step":43,"content":"诺克斯空洞的眼神如同死寂的湖水。以她的精神状态，理解“案件”这个概念或许有些困难。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1020201},{"step":44,"content":"受害者遍布辛迪加和新城，普通市民、商人、黑帮乃至FAC的军官都在此列。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1020201},{"step":45,"content":"我替你回忆一下：红隼俱乐部前首领乌斯曼，新城的能源商人洛维·丹特、FAC特遣队成员达斯汀·霍兹……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1020201},{"step":46,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"名字没有意义。","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1020201},{"step":47,"content":"诺克斯打断了你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1020201},{"step":48,"content":"既然你不知道他们的身份，那你的动机是什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1020201},{"step":49,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"因为我听到了他们的心声，那些呼唤……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1020201},{"step":50,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"他们想活下去。","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1020201},{"step":51,"content":"这番发言激起了你莫名的愤怒与不安。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1020201},{"step":52,"content":"你袭击那些人是因为他们想活下去？！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1020201},{"step":53,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"我在救他们。","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1020201},{"step":54,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"只有消除隔阂，才能共同抵抗内海的召唤。","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1020201},{"step":55,"content":"没有狂热，没有执着，诺克斯用冰冷的语调说出了这番话。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1020201},{"step":56,"content":"正因你了解过诺克斯的禁闭者能力，她所说的这些东西显得更加扭曲。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1020201},{"step":57,"content":"测试音效的打断逻辑","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":51,"course":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":58,"content":"播放一个长音效，会有个前奏，稍等一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":51,"course":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":59,"content":"播放相同音效，会继续延续。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":51,"course":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":60,"content":"暂停配置音效，这里测试一下打断。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":51,"course":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":61,"content":"播放一个稍短的音效，在这里等待它结束。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":51,"course":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":62,"content":"配置同名音效，看能否再次播放。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":51,"course":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":63,"content":"结束测试。","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":51,"course":6,"drawing":1020201},{"step":64,"content":"报告最后的总结令你记忆犹新：","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1020201},{"step":65,"content":"……研究院发去的检测报告证实了我们猜想：对象身体同时呈现出禁闭者、死役等多种性状……\n……\n我们无法准确描述其禁闭者能力。但可以确定的是：对象能够通过某种未知手段成为吸附濒死者意识的母体，并增强自身。现有的理论体系暂时无法解释该能力的运作机理。\n……\n基于现有情报，对象存在严重的安全隐患与潜在威胁性，现阶段不建议将其投入战斗。","style":10,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1020201},{"step":66,"content":"“对象能够通过某种未知手段成为吸附濒死者意识的母体，并增强自身。”","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1020201},{"step":67,"content":"“拯救”不过是个谎言。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1020201},{"step":68,"content":"你的能力，绝非救人的工具。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1020201},{"step":69,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1020201},{"step":70,"content":"诺克斯沉默了一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1020201},{"step":71,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"单个灵魂太过孱弱，唯有依附于……我们。","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1020201},{"step":72,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"对生的渴求，对死的抗拒……我们共同的意志。","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1020201},{"step":73,"content":"“我们”？她称自己为“我们”？","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1020201},{"step":74,"content":"疯狂的猜想占据了你的脑海。如果诺克斯并非“一个人”，而是“一群人”……","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1020201},{"step":75,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"可这是错的……我……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1020201},{"step":76,"content":"在你脑内疯狂分析眼前事态的同时，诺克斯的状况出现了明显的变化。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1020202},{"step":77,"content":"她喃喃自语着，眼中闪过挣扎和迷茫。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1020202},{"step":78,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"这是逃避死亡的唯一方法……也是……我们的约定……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1020202},{"step":79,"content":"小小的挣扎迅速消失殆尽，冰冷残酷的目光重新锁定了你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1020202},{"step":80,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"你……很危险。","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1020202},{"step":81,"speaker":"诺克斯","content":"我们，必须拯救你！","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1020202},{"step":82,"content":"诺克斯的体内逸散出大量灰黑色雾气，你本能地察觉到危险。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1020202},{"step":83,"options":["使用枷锁阻止她"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201071,"trial_step":71,"course":3,"drawing":1020202,"choices":[{"text":"使用枷锁阻止她","goto":72}]},{"step":84,"content":"你立刻起身施放了枷锁，来自意识深处、足以束缚住任何禁闭者的力量向诺克斯涌去。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1020202},{"step":85,"content":"可就在触及到诺克斯的刹那，那骇人声音再度于你耳畔响起，穿过耳膜，直抵识海……","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1020202},{"step":86,"speaker":"？？？","content":"我不想死！","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1020202},{"step":87,"speaker":"？？？","content":"救救我！","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1020202},{"step":88,"speaker":"？？？","content":"我不想变成那样……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1020202},{"step":89,"speaker":"？？？","content":"怪……物……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1020202},{"step":90,"content":"你拖着折断的左腿站在巨大厂房的中央。四周满是尸骸。断裂的胫骨刺破了皮肤，可你却感受不到丝毫痛苦。","style":3,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201078,"trial_step":78},{"step":91,"content":"你不知道自己为何会在这里逃亡，那些字句像肌肉记忆一般涌上喉咙，履行义务似的说了出来。","style":3,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201079,"trial_step":79},{"step":92,"content":"杀了那些该死的叛徒……杀了他们……","style":2,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201080,"trial_step":80},{"step":93,"content":"杀掉看见的每一个人……","style":2,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201081,"trial_step":81},{"step":94,"content":"剧烈的咳嗽打断了你的喃喃自语，空气中弥漫着难闻的铁锈味。","style":3,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201082,"trial_step":82},{"step":95,"content":"俱乐部是我的……","style":2,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201083,"trial_step":83},{"step":96,"content":"你们休想从我手里夺走它！","style":2,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201084,"trial_step":84},{"step":97,"content":"你眼前一片模糊，但你仍能看到，那条报废腿上包裹着一层黑色污泥。","style":3,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201085,"trial_step":85},{"step":98,"content":"很快，整条左腿就被秽物覆盖。","style":3,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201086,"trial_step":86},{"step":99,"content":"面对如此诡异的场景，刚刚那种疯狂的欲求，对复仇的渴望，都被恐惧淹没了。","style":3,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201087,"trial_step":87},{"step":100,"content":"不！不！别过来！我不想死！","style":2,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201088,"trial_step":88},{"step":101,"content":"从我的身上下去！","style":2,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201089,"trial_step":89},{"step":102,"content":"你用匕首狠狠扎进左腿中，用尽全力试图刮下那该死的污泥。可它们却吞没了持刀的手，沿着手臂涌向你。","style":3,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201090,"trial_step":90},{"step":103,"content":"滚开！滚开！","style":2,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201091,"trial_step":91},{"step":104,"content":"我不想死……","style":2,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201092,"trial_step":92},{"step":105,"content":"谁来救救我……","style":2,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201093,"trial_step":93},{"step":106,"content":"仿佛是在回应你的祈求，黑暗中浮现出一道影子，她看着你，却好像看着的又不是‘你’。","style":3,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201094,"trial_step":94},{"step":107,"content":"不对，我不属于这里……你是来带我走的？还是……","style":2,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201095,"trial_step":95},{"step":108,"content":"唰——","style":3,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201096,"trial_step":96},{"step":109,"content":"代替她做出回答的，是利器划过身体的声音。","style":3,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201097,"trial_step":97},{"step":110,"content":"视线逐渐倾斜，天地为之旋转。","style":3,"background":302,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201098,"trial_step":98},{"step":111,"content":"回过神来，那道黑影已经不见了，掠过耳旁的风声和自己沉重的喘息——你发现你自己正在阴暗的小巷中奔跑。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201099,"trial_step":99},{"step":112,"content":"该死，该死！治安官呢？","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201100,"trial_step":100},{"step":113,"content":"那些饭桶怎么还不来？！","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201101,"trial_step":101},{"step":114,"content":"终于，缺乏锻炼的身体到达了极限。你靠在路灯旁，打着石膏的右手扶住胸口，你弯下腰，大口喘着气，心脏几乎要从胸口跳出来。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201102,"trial_step":102},{"step":115,"content":"你决定不逃跑了，事情总得有个解决的办法。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201103,"trial_step":103},{"step":116,"content":"右臂的石膏里藏着你的“秘密武器”，两年前那个穿灰衣服的家伙送你的礼物。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201104,"trial_step":104},{"step":117,"content":"凭着它你安然渡过了数次暗杀与复仇，无论是装备精良的刺客还是有着诡异能力的禁闭者，只要被它击中，断无生还的先例。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201105,"trial_step":105},{"step":118,"content":"虽然有着诡异的副作用——它从某次暗杀之后就与你右手的神经长在了一起，无论如何也无法甩脱。但此刻你握着它，心跳却渐渐平复下来。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201106,"trial_step":106},{"step":119,"content":"只有在这种时候，我才会庆幸还有这玩意儿在……","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201107,"trial_step":107},{"step":120,"content":"我才不会死在这儿。明天这个时候我还是新城的商业新星，没人能把我拖下水！","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201108,"trial_step":108},{"step":121,"content":"不远处的路灯下，一道瘦长的黑影蔓延到了你的脚下。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201109,"trial_step":109},{"step":122,"content":"来了……","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201110,"trial_step":110},{"step":123,"content":"你是西蒙收买来杀我的吧？","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201111,"trial_step":111},{"step":124,"content":"黑影没有回应，只是一步一步地靠近。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201112,"trial_step":112},{"step":125,"content":"那个穷鬼能给你多少，我给十倍。","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201113,"trial_step":113},{"step":126,"content":"不管是权力还是地位，只要你想，就没有我买不来的。","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201114,"trial_step":114},{"step":127,"content":"黑影依旧默不作声，苍白如尸体的面孔逐渐暴露在昏暗的路灯下。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201115,"trial_step":115},{"step":128,"content":"等等！我和雷根家有协议，你不能杀我……","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201116,"trial_step":116},{"step":129,"content":"你故作惊恐地后退，右手的石膏悄悄对准了她。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201117,"trial_step":117},{"step":130,"content":"去死吧！","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201118,"trial_step":118},{"step":131,"content":"十二发暗红色的光束倾泻而出。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201119,"trial_step":119},{"step":132,"content":"不得不说，明明亲自动手是最麻烦的状况。但在扣动扳机时，你依旧感受到了鲜明的愉悦。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201120,"trial_step":120},{"step":133,"content":"你的脑子里已经构想好了之后的计划——打个电话给议员老爷说明情况，拜托他帮你善后，无非是给钱多少的问题。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201121,"trial_step":121},{"step":134,"content":"接着回家，洗个热水澡好好睡一觉。今晚的这些破事儿就都过去了。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201122,"trial_step":122},{"step":135,"speaker":"瘦长黑影","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_123"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201123,"trial_step":123},{"step":136,"content":"暗红色的光芒被形状怪异的武器劈散，面前的女人毫发无伤，继续向你走来。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201124,"trial_step":124},{"step":137,"content":"你徒劳地扣动扳机，但枪口再无动静。你想逃命，可那武器却似乎抽走了你全部的力气。你腿一软跪倒在地上。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201125,"trial_step":125},{"step":138,"content":"噗——","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201126,"trial_step":126},{"step":139,"content":"绑着石膏的右手高高飞起。那一刻，不知为何，你心中仿佛有一块石头落了地。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201127,"trial_step":127},{"step":140,"content":"至少，终于摆脱它了……","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201128,"trial_step":128},{"step":141,"content":"尖锐的触感刺入胸膛，某种温热的东西被抽离出了你的身体。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201129,"trial_step":129},{"step":142,"content":"眼前的一切逐渐被黑暗侵蚀，你什么都看不见，只感觉到意识正被拖拽着，去往下一个冰冷的死亡。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201130,"trial_step":130},{"step":143,"content":"你渐渐不再觉得冷了。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201131,"trial_step":131},{"step":144,"content":"明明已经是十二月了。为什么？妈妈偷偷缴了暖气费吗？","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201132,"trial_step":132},{"step":145,"content":"但还是很饿。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201133,"trial_step":133},{"step":146,"content":"奇怪，妈妈哪去了？","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201134,"trial_step":134},{"step":147,"content":"妈妈——","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201135,"trial_step":135},{"step":148,"content":"你大声叫喊着，漆黑的屋子里没人回应，妈妈一定是出去了。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201136,"trial_step":136},{"step":149,"content":"好饿。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201137,"trial_step":137},{"step":150,"content":"无法忍受的饥饿折磨着你，你在屋子里漫无目的地踱步。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201138,"trial_step":138},{"step":151,"content":"黑暗中，你闻见了厨房里的香味。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201139,"trial_step":139},{"step":152,"content":"对了，妈妈在厨房里留了吃的。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201140,"trial_step":140},{"step":153,"content":"你迫不及待地闯进厨房，将地上的食物塞进嘴里。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201141,"trial_step":141},{"step":154,"content":"肌肉混合着油脂，顺着食道滑进胃里，可你却丝毫没有感到满足，你没来由地感到悲伤。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201142,"trial_step":142},{"step":155,"content":"妈妈……呜呜呜……妈妈……","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201143,"trial_step":143},{"step":156,"content":"你哭泣着，手和嘴却没有停下。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201144,"trial_step":144},{"step":157,"content":"不知何时，一个女人站在了你的身前。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201145,"trial_step":145},{"step":158,"content":"妈……妈……？","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201146,"trial_step":146},{"step":159,"content":"你是来……接我……的嘛？","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201147,"trial_step":147},{"step":160,"content":"我一个人……好害怕……","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201148,"trial_step":148},{"step":161,"content":"我不想……变成……那样……","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201149,"trial_step":149},{"step":162,"content":"不……不对，这不是我！","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201150,"trial_step":150},{"step":163,"content":"你拼命抠着自己的喉咙，试图把刚才吞下去的东西吐出来。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201151,"trial_step":151},{"step":164,"content":"这些东西怎么能吃！它们……他们是被污染的……污染……","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201152,"trial_step":152},{"step":165,"content":"可即便把整只手都伸进了喉咙里，你也感受不到任何异样。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201153,"trial_step":153},{"step":166,"content":"你拿起一旁的厨刀，用尽全力剖开——","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201154,"trial_step":154},{"step":167,"content":"粘稠的黑泥缓缓流出，蠕动着化作怪物……死役。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201155,"trial_step":155},{"step":168,"content":"——死役！","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201156,"trial_step":156},{"step":169,"content":"回想起来的一瞬间，一股剧痛直贯天灵，活像是一把匕首，刺穿了你的精神。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201157,"trial_step":157},{"step":170,"content":"一切都是幻境……我…我是来……！","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201158,"trial_step":158},{"step":171,"content":"你行走在一望无际的湖边。湿润的风吹在你脸上，剧烈的头痛感却换来了难得的清醒。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201159,"trial_step":159},{"step":172,"content":"你是${PlayerName}，MBCC的局长，你原本正在审查禁闭者诺克斯，她袭击了你……","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201160,"trial_step":160},{"step":173,"content":"你很可能正身处她的精神构筑的虚幻空间当中——四周满是游荡的黑影，发出着毫无意义的呻吟。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201161,"trial_step":161},{"step":174,"speaker":"？？？","content":"我不想死……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_162"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201162,"trial_step":162},{"step":175,"speaker":"？？？","content":"我要活着……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_163"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201163,"trial_step":163},{"step":176,"speaker":"？？？","content":"凭什么只有我……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_164"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201164,"trial_step":164},{"step":177,"speaker":"？？？","content":"还不够……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_165"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201165,"trial_step":165},{"step":178,"speaker":"？？？","content":"还要更多……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_166"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201166,"trial_step":166},{"step":179,"content":"不知何时起，四周的黑影注意到了你的存在。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201167,"trial_step":167},{"step":180,"speaker":"？？？","content":"健康的灵魂。","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_168"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201168,"trial_step":168},{"step":181,"speaker":"？？？","content":"他不是我们……","female_content":"她不是我们……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_169","vo_trial_20201_1_169f"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201169,"trial_step":169},{"step":182,"speaker":"？？？","content":"我想要他……","female_content":"我想要她……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_170","vo_trial_20201_1_170f"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201170,"trial_step":170},{"step":183,"content":"你意识到危险，忍受着头痛与精神的混乱感拼命奔跑，进入一栋建筑躲避黑影的追击。","style":3,"background":1037,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201171,"trial_step":171},{"step":184,"content":"循着某种奇妙的感应，你与黑影们周旋许久，最终躲进了一间病房。","style":3,"background":116,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201172,"trial_step":172},{"step":185,"content":"奇怪的是，在这个地方，刚刚的头痛与混乱感消失了。","style":3,"background":116,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201173,"trial_step":173},{"step":186,"content":"病床之上，一位身穿白衣的少女正看着窗外的红色月亮自言自语。","style":3,"background":116,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201174,"trial_step":174},{"step":187,"speaker":"少女","content":"明天，会有太阳吗……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_175"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":116,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201175,"trial_step":175},{"step":188,"content":"少女身材纤弱，有着一头淡金色的柔顺头发，与外面群聚的黑影迥然不同，在这晦暗扭曲的世界中显得格格不入。","style":3,"background":116,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201176,"trial_step":176},{"step":189,"content":"你有一种预感，她知道离开这里的方法。","style":3,"background":116,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201177,"trial_step":177},{"step":190,"options":["询问少女"],"style":6,"background":116,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201178,"trial_step":178,"course":3},{"step":191,"content":"你好，请问……","style":2,"background":116,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201179,"trial_step":179},{"step":192,"content":"你向少女的病床走去。听到你的声音，少女回过头，靛蓝的眼睛格外明亮。","style":3,"background":116,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201180,"trial_step":180},{"step":193,"content":"可就在她看向你的那个刹那，外面传来黑影们的嘶嚎。","style":3,"background":116,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201181,"trial_step":181},{"step":194,"speaker":"少女","content":"你是来看我的吗？","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_182"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":116,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201182,"trial_step":182},{"step":195,"speaker":"少女","content":"可他们好像不欢迎你……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_183"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"background":116,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201183,"trial_step":183},{"step":196,"content":"无数黑影摧毁了病房的门向你涌来，他们拖拽着你的身体，直到黑暗将你吞噬。","style":3,"background":116,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201184,"trial_step":184},{"step":197,"content":"审查室的灯光驱散了黑暗，你靠在椅背上，感受到一种难以言喻的脱力感。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201185,"trial_step":185},{"step":198,"content":"不知何时，一整队荷枪实弹的行动人员围住了你。为首的夜莺面色阴沉。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201186,"trial_step":186},{"step":199,"content":"诺克斯已经被带走了。夜莺察觉到你醒来，神情变得柔和了一些。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201187,"trial_step":187},{"step":200,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，您刚刚失去了意识。","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_188"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201188,"trial_step":188},{"step":201,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"禁闭者诺克斯袭击了您，我们必须采取一些措施……","voice":["vo_trial_20201_1_189"],"voice_bank":"vo_nuokesi_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201189,"trial_step":189},{"step":202,"content":"你疲惫地摇了摇头。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201190,"trial_step":190},{"step":203,"content":"我没事。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201191,"trial_step":191},{"step":204,"content":"我想，我已经找到了解决这个麻烦的办法。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":120201192,"trial_step":192}]}